 "note": "Action verbs as in the shared list (see panel-layers.json): open_testfile, select, select_none, tool <tool id>, choose {target,item} (item path 'A > B'; toolbox.<tool>_flyout picks a flyout entry, orig_index = position in the owner-drawn list of the original), open <logical ui key>, click/double_click/hover <ui key|{handle}|{menu_item}>, drag {from,by|to,mods}, canvas_click/canvas_double_click/canvas_hover [x,y] (+mods), canvas_drag {from,to,mods}, canvas_wheel {pos,delta,modifiers}, key <combo>, repeat/do, type, menu 'A > B', menu_open, set_field {target,value}, jsf (both = fp run_script), record_ui <key>, log_value, log_menu_items, export_png doc, wait, close_all, window_size. Additions in this file: {handle: <index|role>} = control/frame handle of the selected object (orig: controlPoints, fp: autoShape.describe/frame); drag_popup_slider {to_fraction,hold} = drag inside the open popup slider; record_ui history.names = history step names; mods on canvas_click/canvas_hover = held modifier keys. Coordinates are document pixels. Labels are compared without '&' and trailing '...'/'…'.",
